#3000
Outside the Northern Gate of Elrhinn~
   To the south lies the Elrhinn Township, one of the larger towns on
this continent.  It is renowned for its merchants, who bring valuables
from all over the Dominion to sell and trade, and the road here is
rutted deep by the wheels of their wagons.  Tall stone walls stretch
away to either side, their battlements lined with banners of red and
gold.  You see some figures standing around the city gate to the south,
where a large iron portcullis hangs ready to drop.  The Northern Road
leads away north into the countryside.
~
