#3001
Inside the Northern Gate of Elrhinn~
   Rising up before you is a huge iron portcullis, decorated with the
seal of the township of Elrhinn.  To either side of the gate stand the
sturdy town walls, raised centuries ago to protect the town from
unwanted invasion, their gray stones weathered smooth by wind and rain.
The bustle of the town spills out to the south along Northwall Road,
while beyond the gate to the north lies the open road.
