#3010
The End of Dalkyst Road~
   Dalkyst Road ends here at the entrance to two buildings.  To the west
you see a small shop bearing a sign that reads, "Jynnah's Grocery", and
the smell of baking bread wafts from its door.  To the east lies the
Dalkyst Inn, a rambling building of dark timber with smoke curling from
its chimney.  The road leads back south.  To the north a freshly painted
door, hung with a sash of green silk, opens into the guildhall of the
Mercykillers.
