#3011
The Meeting Room of Dalkyst Inn~
   This is the meeting room of the Dalkyst Inn.  It is furnished with
several round tables, thick fur rugs and many chairs, set out in no
discernible order.  The fire in the hearth looks warm and inviting, and
the smell of ale and roasting meat hangs in the air.  An old wooden
staircase leads up to the guest rooms, and the door leads west to the
road.
