#3099
Inside the Chapel~
   The chapel is well lit by a skylight in the ceiling, and a circle of
marble benches surrounds a small podium.  In a niche in the northern
wall a mosaic has been set, its tiny tiles of colored glass glowing
softly.  Under the mosaic stands a table with several lit candles
flickering their gentle light.  A doorway in the south wall leads back
out to the cobbled path and the gardens.
~
