#3100
Above the Gathering Room~
   This room is filled with plush sofas and comfortable chairs for the
use of visiting dignitaries to Elrhinn.  Heavy curtains frame the
windows, and a thick carpet covers the floor.  It is also a popular
place for locals to post notes about items they are selling, trading or
looking to purchase.  A door leads west, and a staircase leads down to
the gathering room.
~
