#3101
The Fletcher's Shop~
   Arrows and bows are hung and displayed all about the shop: longbows
and shortbows, crossbows and bundles of arrows fletched with goose and
hawk feathers.  Curls of wood shavings litter the floor, and the smell
of fresh-cut ash and glue fills the air.  To the north a door leads out
of the shop and back to Dalkyst Road.
~
