#3104
House of the Shadowhunter~
   A single, circular skylight in the center of the ceiling casts an
unearthly glow about this shadow-shrouded chamber.  The walls are gray
stone and the floor white marble.  Chests, tables and other semi-lavish
items of furniture are set about the room, and a silk-covered bed is
pushed against the northern wall.  To the south a doorway leads back to
the streets of Elrhinn.
~
