D2
~
~
0 0 3085
S
#3105
The hidden tower~
   You are standing in the center of a circular tower within the valley.
Odd trinkets dot the floors and desks, and all along the walls are
bookshelves holding tattered documents, books and manuscripts of all
sorts and colors.  The faint scent of sulfur permeates the air, and a
shifting haze which you cannot see directly seems to float before your
eyes.  A door in the eastern part of the tower leads back out to the
misty, damp valley.
~
