#3106
House of Morrolan~
   The room is sparsely furnished save for a bed, a large black chair
and a desk.  Some ornaments hang upon the walls, and a rug made from the
fur of a strange beast spreads itself out upon the wooden floor.  To the
north a door leads out of the home to the street, and a stairway leads
up to the second floor.
~
