#3107
House of Thulin~
   The walls of the house are dark and covered with silk tapestries.
There are windows in the west and east walls looking out on the town of
Elrhinn.  Trinkets and odds and ends are scattered about the room on
shelves, desks and chairs.  To the north is a doorway leading out of the
house, and a stairway leads up to the attic.
