#3110
Thulin's Attic~
   The attic is threadbare, and cobwebs string themselves out in the
corners.  Windows set into the eastern and southern walls of the attic
give a view of the township of Elrhinn.  In the corner of the room, a
spiral stairway descends back down to the ground floor of the house.
~
