#3111
House of Kern~
   The house is made entirely of hard mahogany wood.  The walls bear
weapons, armor and treasures, and a large rug made from the skin of some
obscure beast lies sprawled upon the floor.  There is a strange lamp in
the corner of the room in which red balls of ink float up and down
through a thick fluid, casting strange shadows upon the walls.  A
doorway leads out of the house through the western wall.  Above the door
is the crest of House Kern.
~
