Kern's House~
   The house is sparsely furnished, but the walls are covered with
tapestries depicting battles and ferocious creatures.  In the corner of
the room, beside a velvet couch, a strange lamp rests upon a table of
cherrywood, a red, inky substance floating up and down within it and
casting shadows upon the wall.  To the north is a doorway leading back
to the streets of the town.
