#3120
Foyer of Watcher Manor~
   You step into a huge manor house, made entirely of marble.  On the
floor before you is the setting sun, the symbol of the Watchers, made of
gold and inlaid into the marble floor.  A large fireplace sits next to a
brass door to the north.  A winding staircase leads up to another brass
door, and there are matching doors to the east and west.  South of here
is the exit to the streets of Elrhinn.
