#3122
Tyrstan's Room~
   You have entered the house of Tyrstan Strykrr.  The floor is marble
inlaid with gold, with a giant sun in its center, the symbol of the
Order of the Watchers.  A massive black marble fireplace roars at the
back of the room, and chairs of highly polished wood sit before it,
looking very inviting.  Books line the walls, telling the stories and
fables of the Dominion.  Large chests sit in the corners of the room,
holding equipment gathered on many journeys.  A door leads south to the
foyer.
~
